      "releaseNotes": "New July filters have been added.\n\n- hush (hush blush)\nIf you love muted colors and a calm aesthetic, this filter is for you.\nPair it with the Grain effect to give your selfies and everyday vlogs an even more aesthetic look.\n\n- mint (digi-mint)\nA dreamy mint-toned digital camera filter inspired by the looks often seen on Pinterest.\nEven photos taken on rainy or cloudy days can become effortlessly more atmospheric.",
